window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"gwen","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Skill","Skill","Locke","Locke","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 3","text":"Hallowed Mist online — his Ashen Pursuit blink stops working into the fog."},{"when":"Enemy 6 + first item","text":"Purgatory grounds AND executes — no E out, so never dip low inside it."},{"when":"2+ items","text":"Mist plus Needlework outs restore the even game — and now your scaling talks."}],"wants":{"you":["Even farm through the stalemate","W held for his engage, always","Scaling — every even minute is yours"],"foe":["A catch with Hallowed Mist down","Grounded execute picks","Denial of your free-scaling farm"]},"early":"This lane is a long stalemate and you profit from it: Q Snip Snip! true damage matches his chip, and from level 3 Hallowed Mist blanks the Ashen Pursuit blink his kit is built around — a flat 10s, so the window after it is yours. Farm, trade evenly, and guard one rule: W is for his commit, never poke.","mid":"His 6-plus-first-item stretch is the only dangerous chapter: Purgatory grounds you, so Skip 'n Slash will not fire, and then executes a Gwen caught low. Track its 120 seconds, hug the wave, refuse the catch. Meanwhile your items stack attack speed and AP, and by the time his window closes your Q shred genuinely hurts.","late":"Two-plus items the matchup is even on paper and yours in practice — Hallowed Mist and Needlework range give you outs from every pick attempt, while your sustained shred beats his one-rotation burst in longer fights. Side-lane with mist available, force him to engage into it, and snowball every fight he fumbles trying to reach you.","whys":["Level 1 is even — both of you poke, and neither has engage tools online.","Level 2 stays skill — Q Snip Snip! true damage matches his passive chip evenly.","Level 3 is even: Hallowed Mist blanks his E gap-close attempts, and he has to respect the fog.","Levels 4-5 remain a skill stalemate — neither side can afford to commit.","Level 6 opens his window: Purgatory grounds and executes, so a Gwen caught low inside it cannot even Skip 'n Slash out.","First item is Locke's window — Purgatory grounds you so Skip 'n Slash will not fire, and then executes a Gwen caught with W down. Play this stretch tight.","2+ items returns to skill — Hallowed Mist and Needlework range give you escape outs from his pick attempts."]});
